  },
  "review_notes": [
    "static_source_file lists internal/audit/hooks.go but scip_document does not; scip_documents_closed is present, so static_file_unindexed derives for that path.",
    "The positive capability is unaffected: every hop of GetJob -> Fetch -> Repo#Get is indexed.",
    "No authz symbol is reached and static_reachability_closed is withheld, so static_route_authorization_gap cannot derive: unresolved, never supported."
